/godotengine/godot/pull/98379#issuecomment-2707587950 that this was a desired feature\r\n\r\nThis adds support for debugging multiple threads through DAP, bringing feature parity with https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/76582.\r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1a2d5b9f-e28b-4de0-97aa-b7eab34dbef2\r\n\r\n> [!NOTE]\r\n> This includes some misc changes ranging from code cleanups to fixing bad behaviors from the spec. If desired, I can separate them in other dependent PRs\r\n\r\n> [!WARNING]\r\n> This implementation is not perfect, and some issues/odd behaviors are coming from Godot itself. This serves as a first implementation, but subsequent work is planned to make multi-thread debugging more robust, both from Godot and DAP.\r\n\r\n\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://ap